; End-to-end fixture for the inline_tests backend: a real library
; preprocessed with ppx_windtrap, driven by dune's generated runner
; under @runtest. Exercises the payload-shape matrix (multiline,
; newline-leading, empty-literal, bare, exact, output) and
; module%test / let%test / let%expect_test nesting against the live
; promotion protocol. The adversarial promote-loop check (break a
; payload, see the diff, dune promote restores this exact file) is
; run transiently against these sources.

; Quiet-on-green: the generated runner runs once per partition; without
; WINDTRAP_QUIET each partition pays three lines of windtrap chrome for
; a handful of trivial tests. Failure output is untouched.

(env
 (_
  (env-vars
   (WINDTRAP_QUIET 1))))

(library
 (name windtrap_test_ppx_inline)
 (inline_tests)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_windtrap)))
